நீர்","gloss":"water"},{"text":"திகழ்","lemma":"திகழ்","gloss":"shining"}],"gloss":"water-shining"},{"surface":"சிலம்பின்","parts":[{"text":"சிலம்பு","lemma":"சிலம்பு","gloss":"mountain slope"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of the mountain slope"},{"surface":"ஓராங்","parts":[{"text":"ஓராங்","lemma":"ஓராங்","gloss":"together"}],"gloss":"together","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கவிழ்ந்த","parts":[{"text":"கவிழ்ந்த","lemma":"கவிழ்ந்த","gloss":"blossomed"}],"gloss":"blossomed","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வெண்கூ","parts":[{"text":"வெண்கூ","lemma":"வெண்கூ","gloss":"white"}],"gloss":"white","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தாளத்","parts":[{"text":"தாளத்","lemma":"தாளத்","gloss":"of the kutalam plant"}],"gloss":"of the kutalam plant","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தந்தூம்பு","parts":[{"text":"தந்தூம்பு","lemma":"தந்தூம்பு","gloss":"beautiful tube-like"}],"gloss":"beautiful tube-like","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"புதுமலர்","parts":[{"text":"புது","lemma":"புதுமை","gloss":"new"},{"text":"மலர்","lemma":"மலர்","gloss":"flower"}],"gloss":"new flowers"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஆர்கழல்","parts":[{"text":"ஆர்","lemma":"ஆர்","gloss":"tight-fitting ring"},{"text":"கழல்","lemma":"கழல்","gloss":"slipping"}],"gloss":"slipping onto a tight ring"},{"surface":"புகுவ","parts":[{"text":"புகுவ","lemma":"புகு","gloss":"entering"}],"gloss":"entering"},{"surface":"போலச்","parts":[{"text":"போலச்","lemma":"போலச்","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சோர்குவ","parts":[{"text":"சோர்குவ","lemma":"சோர்","gloss":"they will slip"}],"gloss":"they will slip off"},{"surface":"வல்ல","parts":[{"text":"வல்ல","lemma":"வல்","gloss":"not"}],"gloss":"not"},{"surface":"என்பர்கொல்","parts":[{"text":"என்பர்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"will he say"},{"text":"கொல்","lemma":"கொல்","gloss":"particle of doubt"}],"gloss":"will he say?"},{"surface":"நமரே","parts":[{"text":"நமர்","lemma":"நமர்","gloss":"our lover"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"our lover"}]}],"literal":"Having attained its prime, of the millet, on the red high ground sprouted / forked sprout's dark black single leaf / the doe, its young fawn, having nipped, satisfies its duty / the rainy-season-welcoming cool field if he sees, the bangles on the hand / on the water-shining mountain slope, together blossomed / white kutalam's beautiful tubular new flowers / like entering a tight-fitting ring / will he say they will not slip off, our lover?","translation":"When our lover sees the cool upland fields welcoming the rains, where the doe feeds her young fawn by nipping the dark, single leaf of the forked millet sprout growing luxuriantly on the red high ground, will he still say that the bangles on my hands will not slip off? They will slide down like the beautiful, new, tube-like white flowers of the kutalam plant, blossoming all at once on the wet mountain slopes, sliding onto a tight-fitting ring.","modern":"பருவம் வந்த வரகின் சிவந்த நிலத்தில் செழித்து வளர்ந்த, கவடுள்ள முளையின் காரிருள் போன்ற ஒற்றை இலையை, பிணை மான் தன் இளங்கன்றுடன் கவ்வித் தின்று தன் பசியைத் தீர்த்துக்கொள்ளும். கார் காலத்தை வரவேற்கும் அத்தகைய குளிர்ந்த புனத்தைக் காணும்போது, நீர் வழியும் மலைச்சரிவில் ஒருசேர மலர்ந்த வெண்கூதாளத்தின் அழகிய குழல் போன்ற புதிய மலர்கள் இறுக்கமான வளையலுக்குள் நுழைவது போல, என் கைகளில் உள்ள வளையல்கள் கழன்று விழாமல் இருக்கும் என்று நம் காதலர் சொல்வாரோ? மாட்டார்.","explanation":"The companion speaks to the heroine as the rainy season begins, expressing her worry about the hero's delay. She describes the lush landscape where the doe feeds her young fawn with the dark leaves of sprouted millet on red soil. On the wet mountain slopes, the white kutalam flowers open up all at once. The companion compares these tubular white flowers sliding down to the heroine's bangles slipping off her thinning arms due to the grief of separation. She wonders if the hero, upon seeing these clear signs of the rainy season, could possibly think that the heroine's bangles would remain secure.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,1.1],[1.1,1.5],[1.5,1.7],[1.7,2.5],[2.5,3.0],[3.0,3.38],[3.38,3.9],[3.9,4.9],[4.9,5.4],[5.4,5.8],[5.8,6.6],[6.6,7.35],[7.35,8.1],[8.1,8.4],[8.4,8.6],[8.6,9.8],[9.8,10.4],[10.4,10.8],[11.05,11.3],[11.3,12.3],[12.3,12.48],[12.48,13.1],[13.1,13.6],[13.6,14.1],[14.1,14.4],[14.4,14.7],[14.7,14.7],[14.7,14.7],[14.7,16.19],[16.56,17.3]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.5],[1.5,1.7],[1.7,2.8],[2.8,3.3],[3.3,3.67],[3.67,4.3],[4.3,4.7],[4.7,5.7],[5.7,6.05],[6.05,6.72],[6.72,6.72],[6.72,6.8],[6.8,8.9],[8.9,9.1],[9.1,10.5],[10.5,11.1],[11.1,11.55],[11.55,11.89],[12.0,13.1],[13.1,13.34],[13.34,14.0],[14.0,14.7],[14.7,15.4],[15.4,15.7],[15.7,15.9],[15.9,17.5],[17.5,17.9],[17.9,18.5],[18.5,18.8]]},"sync":[[["செவ்விகொள்","having attained its prime"]],[["வரகின்","of the millet"]],[["செஞ்சுவற்","on the red high ground"]],[["கலித்த","luxuriantly sprouted"]],[["கௌவை","fork-shaped"]],[["நாற்றின்","of the sprout"]],[["காரிருள்","dark black"]],[["காரிருள்","dark black"],["ஓரிலை","single leaf"]],[["நவ்வி","doe"]],[["நாண்மறி","young fawn"]],[["கவ்விக்","having nipped"]],[["கடன்கழிக்கும்","satisfying its hunger"]],[["காரெதிர்","welcoming the rains"]],[["தண்புனங்","cool upland field"]],[["காணிற்","if he sees"]],[["கைவளை","the bangles on the hand"]],[["நீர்திகழ்","water-shining"]],[["சிலம்பின்","of the mountain slope"]],[["ஓராங்","together"]],[["கவிழ்ந்த","blossomed"]],[["வெண்கூ","white"]],[["தாளத்","of the kutalam plant"]],[["தந்தூம்பு","beautiful tube-like"]],[["புதுமலர்","new flowers"]],[["ஆர்கழல்","slipping onto a tight ring"]],[["புகுவ","entering"]],[["போலச்","like"]],[["சோர்குவ","they will slip off"]],[["வல்ல","not"]],[["என்பர்கொல்","will he say?"]],[["நமரே","our lover"]]]}